{
  "name": "Automated Global B2B Email, MX, SPF & DMARC Deliverability Auditor — Daily B2B Data & Compliance Pipeline",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automated Global B2B Email, MX, SPF & DMARC Deliverability Auditor Pipeline (Daily B2B M2M Workflow)\n\n**Overview:**\nHigh-speed asynchronous B2B email and corporate domain auditor via DNS-over-HTTPS (Cloudflare & Google DNS). Validates RFC 5322 syntax, disposable domains, MX records, email provider (Google Workspace, Microsoft 365, Proofpoint, Mimecast), SPF, and DMARC policies.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [b2b-quant-apis/global-b2b-email-domain-security-auditor](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/global-b2b-email-domain-security-auditor)\n\n### Quick Setup (2 Minutes):\n1. Create a free Apify account and copy your personal token from **Settings -> Integrations**.\n2. Open the **Apify Engine: global-b2b-email-domain-security-auditor** HTTP Request node and configure a **Header Auth** credential with:\n   - **Name:** `Authorization`\n   - **Value:** `Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN_HERE>`\n3. Customize the JSON input payload in the HTTP Request node and set your destination Webhook/Slack URL.\n4. Toggle the workflow **Active** to run automatically every morning at 07:00 AM!",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "9116aaef-5326-589e-bc66-d5f037996438",
      "name": "Setup Instructions & Architecture",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 7 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "4e3ba93e-c5c0-53eb-8d7c-e3e5ae7c26a4",
      "name": "Daily 07:00 AM Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/b2b-quant-apis~global-b2b-email-domain-security-auditor/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"domains\": [\n    \"stripe.com\",\n    \"shopify.com\",\n    \"cloudflare.com\"\n  ],\n  \"check_dmarc\": true\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
